# Route: guide 37 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 54 to 56, 57
# quests, 5.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Western Plaguelands, Burning Steppes): Sorrow Hill -> Ruins of
# Andorhal -> Felstone Field -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Felstone Field ->
# Northridge Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> The Weeping Cave -> Northridge
# Lumber Camp -> Hearthglen -> Northridge Lumber Camp -> Sorrow Hill -> Ruins
# of Andorhal -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Dragonkin Menace (4182; Black
# Dragonspawn 52-53, Black Drake 50-52, Black Wyrmkin 53-54).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Barov Family Fortune (5343), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the
# Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Dark
# Iron Legacy (3802), A Taste of Flame (4024), The Heart of the Mountain
# (4123), Marshal Windsor (4241), Incendius! (4263), Put Her Down (4701), Egg
# Freezing (4734), Egg Collection (4735), Doomrigger's Clasp (4764), Maxwell's
# Mission (5081), General Drakkisath's Demise (5102).

